      "role": "user",
      "content": "Exactly, it's basically just a playground for the big powers. Beyond the Security Council, do you think the whole idea of \"international law\" is actually a useful concept for smaller nations, or is it just a tool used by globalist institutions to impose their own values on sovereign states?",
